pageType: content
background:
  type: image
  src: "media/template-inner.png"
  fit: {mode: cover}
elements:
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [58, 44, 820, 48]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      text: 案例二关键实现｜费用计算与限额规则分层
  - elementId: lead
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 100, 840, 30]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      text: 计算负责形成统一事实，规则负责决定治理动作，二者通过明确的数据契约衔接。
  - elementId: code-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 148, 550, 282]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$ink"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$ink"}
  - elementId: code
    elementType: text
    bounds: [76, 162, 518, 254]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Consolas"
      fontSize: 11.2
      color: "$white"
      lineHeight: 1.2
      text: |
        func (c SpendLimitConfig) LimitForKey(keyHash string) SpendLimit {
          if limit, ok := c.OverrideForKey(keyHash); ok {
            return limit
          }
          return c.DefaultLimit()
        }

        func (c SpendLimitConfig) EffectiveFallbackModel() string {
          model := strings.TrimSpace(c.FallbackModel)
          if model == "" { return DefaultFallbackModel }
          return model
        }

        // failed events are excluded from spend totals
        // cost = prompt + cache + completion price
  - elementId: r-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [650, 148, 250, 30]
    content:
      style: "$label"
      text: DESIGN DECISIONS
  - elementId: r
    elementType: text
    bounds: [650, 188, 250, 214]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.3
      text: |
        <p><strong>规则优先级</strong>：Key override 命中时覆盖默认限额。</p>
        <p><strong>统一度量</strong>：cost 与 tokens 采用相同的窗口与状态口径。</p>
        <p><strong>成本准确</strong>：输入、缓存、输出分别按模型价格计算。</p>
        <p><strong>失败隔离</strong>：failed 请求不进入限额账单，避免误触发治理动作。</p>
  - elementId: source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 464, 840, 20]
    content:
      style: "$bodySmall"
      fontSize: 11
      text: 代码位置：usage-service/internal/store/spend_limit.go、collector/spend_limit.go、src/services/api/quotaLimits.ts。
